Package: osiris-theme-gnome
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends:
 gnome-shell-extension-prefs,
 osiris-icon-theme (= ${source:Version})
Description: OSIRIS dual-accent GNOME theme (GTK 3/4 + GNOME Shell + Metacity)
 Cyan/rose colour theme for GTK 3, GTK 4 / libadwaita, GNOME Shell and Metacity
 (Flashback/Marco), matching the OSIRIS design system (docs/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md).
 Ships the "Osiris" (dark) and "Osiris-Light" theme variants, the
 `osiris-gtk-theme` helper (also sets the Osiris icon theme), the GtkSourceView
 syntax schemes, the "Osiris" Ptyxis terminal palette, and a GNOME Terminal
 profile installer under /usr/share/osiris/gnome-terminal.
 No Qt/KDE dependencies — safe to install on a pure GNOME desktop.

Package: osiris-theme-gtk
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 osiris-theme-gnome (= ${source:Version})
Description: transitional package for osiris-theme-gnome
 The GTK/GNOME theme moved to its own package, osiris-theme-gnome, so a GNOME
 desktop can be themed without pulling in the KDE/Qt bits. This empty package
 exists only to keep `apt install osiris-theme-gtk` working.

Package: osiris-theme-plasma
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qt5-style-kvantum, qt6-style-kvantum
Description: OSIRIS dual-accent KDE Plasma / Qt theme
 Plasma colour schemes (Osiris / Osiris Light), Kvantum Qt themes
 (OsirisDark / OsirisLight), the OsirisDark Aurorae window decoration, the
 "Osiris" Plasma desktop theme and the Konsole "Osiris Dark/Light" colour
 schemes.

Package: osiris-icon-theme
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, hicolor-icon-theme
Recommends: adwaita-icon-theme
Description: OSIRIS Material Symbols Rounded icon theme
 Freedesktop icon theme in the Material Symbols Rounded 300 visual language — cyan/rose on a
 GitHub-flavoured ramp. Covers actions, apps, categories, devices, emblems,
 mimetypes, places and status, with GNOME↔KDE compatibility symlinks. Inherits
 Adwaita / Breeze / GNOME / hicolor for anything unstyled. Installed as
 /usr/share/icons/Osiris.

Package: osiris-theme-grub
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, grub-common
Description: OSIRIS graphical GRUB2 boot theme
 1920x1080 boot menu in the OSIRIS visual language — Fira Code, cyan selection,
 rose countdown bar, generated boot-menu icons. The post-install hook copies the
 theme into /boot/grub, sets GRUB_THEME and regenerates grub.cfg.

Package: osiris-wallpapers
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: OSIRIS wallpapers (Abstract Bloom + Ancient Egypt Sci-Fi)
 Fixed Day/Night renders at 4 resolutions plus GNOME time-of-day dynamic XML and
 KDE Plasma light/dark wallpaper packages. Installed under
 /usr/share/backgrounds/osiris.

Package: osiris-desktop-theme
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 osiris-theme-gnome (= ${source:Version}),
 osiris-theme-plasma (= ${source:Version}),
 osiris-icon-theme (= ${source:Version}),
 osiris-theme-grub (= ${source:Version}),
 osiris-wallpapers (= ${source:Version}),
Description: OSIRIS desktop theme (metapackage)
 Pulls in every OSIRIS theme component: GNOME/GTK, KDE Plasma/Qt, the icon theme,
 the GRUB boot theme and the wallpapers. The Plasma component is pure data and
 only Suggests the Kvantum Qt style, so this metapackage does not install Qt
 on a GNOME-only system; for GNOME alone use osiris-theme-gnome.

Package: osiris-archive-keyring
Section: misc
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: OSIRIS APT repository signing key and source
 Installs the OSIRIS archive signing key and an APT source for
 https://richardblaha.github.io/osiris-deb-repo, so the OSIRIS packages are
 updated by apt like any other package.
